@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam arrowColor MODEL_COLOR
skinparam classBackgroundColor MODEL_COLOR
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 35

class "<<interface>>\nModel" as Model
class ModelManager
class AddressBook
class StudentRoster
class "<<interface>>\nObservableList<Student>" as RosterList
class "FilteredList<Student>" as FilteredStudents
class StudentDisplayList
class "<<interface>>\nPredicate<Student>" as Predicate
class StudentFilterPredicate

ModelManager .up.|> Model
ModelManager --> "1" AddressBook
AddressBook *--> "1" StudentRoster
StudentRoster --> "1" RosterList : roster view
ModelManager --> "1" FilteredStudents : filteredStudents
ModelManager --> "1" StudentDisplayList : displayedStudents
StudentDisplayList --> "1" FilteredStudents : source
FilteredStudents --> "1" RosterList : source
FilteredStudents --> "0..1" Predicate : predicate
StudentFilterPredicate .up.|> Predicate

note bottom of RosterList
  Students remain in stored roster order.
  List implementation details are omitted.
end note

note bottom of StudentFilterPredicate
  Optional level and subject criteria use AND.
  Search can supply a different predicate.
end note

note bottom of StudentDisplayList
  Keeps a permutation of filtered occurrences.
  Model#getStudentList() returns an unmodifiable view.
  A new predicate resets the display order.
  Sorting changes neither records nor roster order.
end note

legend bottom
  Partial view of ModelManager's list wiring.
  Inherited library source references are shown directly.
endlegend
@enduml
